concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-34aa-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "34AA(3) Disclosure of IPO information to the Ombudsman and the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-34aa-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In this section: Australian Designated Authority has the same meaning as in Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979. Australian Designated Authority official means:  (a) the Australian Designated Authority; or  (b) a person who:  (i) is an APS employee in the Department administered by the Attorney-General; and  (ii) has duties relating to the functions or powers of the Australian Designated Authority under Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979. IPO information means:  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(3) In this section: Australian Designated Authority has the same meaning as in Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979. Australian Designated Authority official means:  (a) the Australian Designated Authority; or  (b) a person who:  (i) is an APS employee in the Department administered by the Attorney-General; and  (ii) has duties relating to the functions or powers of the Australian Designated Authority under Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979. IPO information means:  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
