concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-5-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Voice call application service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-5-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Schedule, voice call application service means a service that enables end-users to make or receive voice calls to or from other end-users using a transmission service.  (2) For the purposes of subclause (1), it is immaterial whether the service also enables end-users to make or receive voice calls to or from persons (other than end-users) using a transmission service. Example: A VOIP service that enables end-users to make voice calls to, or receive voice calls from, any telephone number.  (3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a voice call application service merely because the person supplies a transmission service that enables voice calls to be made or received.  (4) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a voice call application service merely because the person provides a billing service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a voice call application service." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Schedule, voice call application service means a service that enables end-users to make or receive voice calls to or from other end-users using a transmission service.  (2) For the purposes of subclause (1), it is immaterial whether the service also enables end-users to make or receive voice calls to or from persons (other than end-users) using a transmission service. Example: A VOIP service that enables end-users to make voice calls to, or receive voice calls from, any telephone number.  (3) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a voice call application service merely because the person supplies a transmission service that enables voice calls to be made or received.  (4) For the purposes of this Schedule, a person does not provide a voice call application service merely because the person provides a billing service, or a fee collection service, in relation to a voice call application service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e9ae4231edbe67dea7b8261aa73ada77212dfd7b1fc5a6ae845c3fda791f3ac9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "39"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-5-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-5-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-5-2-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-5-2-ss-4 ;
