doc:sch-1-sec-10-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(2) Uploaded material" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of the application of this Schedule to a prescribed communications provider that is a body corporate, the provider is based in a foreign country if, and only if:  (a) the provider is incorporated in the foreign country; or  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-11-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Intended recipient of a communication"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-11-2 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Schedule, the intended recipient of a communication is:  (a) if the communication is addressed to an individual (either in the individual’s own capacity or in the capacity of an employee or agent of another person)—the individual; or  (b) if the communication is addressed to a person who is not an individual—the person; or  (c) if the communication is not addressed to a person—the person who has, or whose employee or agent has, control over the individual transmission service that was used to receive the communication." ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of this Schedule, the intended recipient of a communication is:  (a) if the communication is addressed to an individual (either in the individual’s own capacity or in the capacity of an employee or agent of another person)—the individual; or  (b) if the communication is addressed to a person who is not an individual—the person; or  (c) if the communication is not addressed to a person—the person who has, or whose employee or agent has, control over the individual transmission service that was used to receive the communication."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9ba240184b6de2bdc3c1a02c2f83645948a6ce748dd6e3d74c4d9fc377484cf2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines intended recipient of a communication" ;
