doc:sch-1-sec-17-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17(1) Nominated AAT Security Division member" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Attorney-General may, by writing, nominate a person who:  (a) holds one of the following appointments to the Administrative Appeals Tribunal:  (ii) senior member (of any level);  (iii) member (of any level); and  (b) is a member of the Security Division of the Administrative Appeals Tribunal; to issue international production orders under Part 4 of this Schedule." ;
