concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-17a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17A(3) Urgent circumstances"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-17a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, it is necessary, because of urgent circumstances, for the Attorney-General to consent orally to the making of an application under Part 4 of this Schedule for an international production order if, and only if:  (a) the delay caused by consenting in writing may be prejudicial to security; and  (b) it is not practicable in the circumstances to consent in writing." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of this Schedule, it is necessary, because of urgent circumstances, for the Attorney-General to consent orally to the making of an application under Part 4 of this Schedule for an international production order if, and only if:  (a) the delay caused by consenting in writing may be prejudicial to security; and  (b) it is not practicable in the circumstances to consent in writing."@en ;
