doc:sch-1-sec-23-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23(2) Form of application" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the person making an application under clause 22 for an international production order on an interception agency’s behalf:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subclause (3); and  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone; the person may make the application by telephone. Note: See also clause 17A (urgent circumstances) and clause 172 (action required)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-23-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23(3) Form of application"@en ;
