    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35-2 ;
    values:originalText "An application under clause 33 must, if it is in writing, set out:  (a) the name of the criminal law-enforcement agency; and  (b) the name of the person making the application on the agency’s behalf.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
