concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-36-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Affidavits to accompany written application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-36-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application under clause 33 must, if it is in writing, be accompanied by an affidavit complying with this clause.  (2) The affidavit must set out the facts and other grounds on which the application is based.  (3) Despite subclause (1), a written application may be accompanied by 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, apart from this subclause, this clause would have required an affidavit accompanying the application to set out." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An application under clause 33 must, if it is in writing, be accompanied by an affidavit complying with this clause.  (2) The affidavit must set out the facts and other grounds on which the application is based.  (3) Despite subclause (1), a written application may be accompanied by 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, apart from this subclause, this clause would have required an affidavit accompanying the application to set out."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4757143c2ebdea39aaf919a44364652b49ed55e517fba02354e43ce1a2baad46" ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-36-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-36-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-36-2-ss-3 ;
