concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-38-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38 Giving further information to issuing authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-38-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An issuing authority may require further information to be given in connection with an application under clause 33 to the issuing authority for an international production order.  (2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the issuing authority directs.  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021  Subdivision B—International production orders relating to stored communications" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An issuing authority may require further information to be given in connection with an application under clause 33 to the issuing authority for an international production order.  (2) The further information:  (a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing; and  (b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the issuing authority directs.  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021  Subdivision B—International production orders relating to stored communications"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "60d0c3becce2ebd8409b3c333761148a3d725f899ab1724895c6c87444ca8cac" ;
