doc:sch-1-sec-43-2-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "43(1) Form of application" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application under clause 42 must be in writing." ;
    cof:pageNumber "73"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-43-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "43(2) Form of application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-43-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, a person making the application on the enforcement agency’s behalf may make the application by telephone if the person:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subclause (3); and  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone. Note: See also clause 17A (urgent circumstances) and clause 172 (action required)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, a person making the application on the enforcement agency’s behalf may make the application by telephone if the person:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subclause (3); and  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone. Note: See also clause 17A (urgent circumstances) and clause 172 (action required)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "97eeefc881512d83c5614e4b1a9dfd781c96c7e95999e9d9508056cbf3e99c40" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-43-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "73"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Telephone application permitted under urgent circumstances" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
