doc:sch-1-sec-49-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "49(5) Content of international production order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021  (a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the enforcement agency directly; or  (b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the enforcement agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority." ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-49-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "49(6) Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-49-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with matters of timing. Example: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications data that commences to be held by a prescribed communications provider during a specified period, the requirement may require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the enforcement agency within 30 minutes after the telecommunications data commences to be held." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with matters of timing. Example: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications data that commences to be held by a prescribed communications provider during a specified period, the requirement may require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the enforcement agency within 30 minutes after the telecommunications data commences to be held."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "80163eed0d75a8ccb39c0a00cc9332e14f33bd122a14a93d33d82c8cab16647e" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-49 ;
