    values:originalText "(3) The application must be made on the control order IPO agency’s behalf by:  (a) if the agency is referred to in subclause 22(3)—a person referred to in that subclause in relation to the agency; or  (b) otherwise:  (i) the chief officer of the agency; or  (ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who holds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency nominated under subclause (4)." ;
