doc:sch-1-sec-61-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "61(4) Content of international production order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to intercept communications, the order may require the provider to:  (a) intercept those communications in a specified way; and  (b) make those intercepted communications available to the control order IPO agency in a specified way." ;
