concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-61-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "61(5) Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-61-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:  (a) require that intercepted communications be made available to the control order IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that intercepted communications be made available to the control order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:  (a) require that intercepted communications be made available to the control order IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that intercepted communications be made available to the control order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6abc5ccc13f61fcc2923a6422fe8295713cb6ea8bc174d10731a18fe64319cea" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-61 ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempt intercepted communications from direct availability to IPO agency." ;
