concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-69 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "69 Issue of international production order—control order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-69 ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies if a control order IPO agency applies, under clause 63, to an issuing authority for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the issuing authority is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the issuing authority under this Division in connection with the application, that:  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies if a control order IPO agency applies, under clause 63, to an issuing authority for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the issuing authority is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the issuing authority under this Division in connection with the application, that:  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "101"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-69-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-69-ss-2 ;
