doc:sch-1-sec-70-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "70(6) Content of international production order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to disclose telecommunications data to the control order IPO agency, the order may require the provider to disclose that data to the agency in a specified way." ;
    cof:pageNumber "106"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-70-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70(7) Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-70-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) A requirement under subclause (6) may:  (a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority." ;
    skos:definition "(7) A requirement under subclause (6) may:  (a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority."@en ;
