concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-72 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "72 Application for international production order—control order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-72 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A control order IPO agency may apply to an issuing authority for an international production order under clause 78 that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person; and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.  (2) The application must nominate a designated international agreement.  (3) The application must be made on the control order IPO agency’s behalf by an authorised officer of the agency." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A control order IPO agency may apply to an issuing authority for an international production order under clause 78 that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person; and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.  (2) The application must nominate a designated international agreement.  (3) The application must be made on the control order IPO agency’s behalf by an authorised officer of the agency."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "18d3202a66b23526814c07900ef8ac26f1cd08a35a43e0a7b8f0618943f2e631" ;
    cof:pageNumber "108"^^xsd:integer ;
