doc:sch-1-sec-73-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "73(1) Form of application" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application under clause 72 must be in writing." ;
    cof:pageNumber "108"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-73-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73(2) Form of application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, a person making the application on the control order IPO agency’s behalf may make the application by telephone if the person:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subclause (3); and  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone. Note: See also clause 17A (urgent circumstances) and clause 172 (action required).  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021" ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, a person making the application on the control order IPO agency’s behalf may make the application by telephone if the person:  (a) is the chief officer of the agency or a person in relation to whom an authorisation by the chief officer is in force under subclause (3); and  (b) thinks it necessary, because of urgent circumstances, to make the application by telephone. Note: See also clause 17A (urgent circumstances) and clause 172 (action required).  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "04b4d82aa8e6e165ae18556cb512b5bcd9d0618581ad9816ab650b8489714733" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-73 ;
    cof:pageNumber "108"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Telephone application permitted under urgent circumstances" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
