concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-73-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73(3) Form of application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The chief officer of a control order IPO agency may, in writing, authorise persons (including classes of persons) for the purposes of subclause (2). However, each person must be entitled under clause 72 to make applications on the agency’s behalf." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The chief officer of a control order IPO agency may, in writing, authorise persons (including classes of persons) for the purposes of subclause (2). However, each person must be entitled under clause 72 to make applications on the agency’s behalf."@en ;
