concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79(5) Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-79-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:  (a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:  (a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ebbc2097ec47437c60c24f04632d44adb0442e02970fb5d83bfbe1a257649ce8" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79 ;
