doc:sch-1-sec-79-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "79(5) Content of international production order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:  (a) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency directly; or  (b) require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency indirectly via the Australian Designated Authority." ;
    cof:pageNumber "114"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79(6) Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-79-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with matters of timing. Example: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications data that commences to be held by a prescribed communications provider during a specified period, the requirement may require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency within 30 minutes after the telecommunications data commences to be held." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of this clause, a specified way may deal with matters of timing. Example: If a requirement under subclause (4) relates to telecommunications data that commences to be held by a prescribed communications provider during a specified period, the requirement may require that the telecommunications data be disclosed to the control order IPO agency within 30 minutes after the telecommunications data commences to be held."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5edb8d107030258bb7ca35bc26e7bd36e03fc66c2f0468deff2754e4e743248f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79 ;
    cof:pageNumber "114"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Deals with matters of timing for telecommunications data disclosure." ;
