concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Issue of further international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 78; and  (b) the original order was in respect of a particular person; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider;  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "If:  (a) an international production order (the original order) was issued under clause 78; and  (b) the original order was in respect of a particular person; and  (c) the original order was directed to a prescribed communications provider;  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
