concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-81 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "81 Notification to Ombudsman by control order IPO agencies in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-81 ;
    values:originalText "relation to international production orders  (1) Within 3 months after an international production order is issued under this Part in response to an application by a control order IPO agency, the chief officer of the agency must:  (a) notify the Ombudsman that the order has been issued; and  (b) give to the Ombudsman a copy of the order.  (2) If the chief officer of a control order IPO agency contravenes paragraph 114(1)(d) of this Schedule (so far as that paragraph relates to an international production order issued under this Part), the chief officer must:  (a) notify the Ombudsman of the contravention; and  (b) do so as soon as practicable after the contravention.  (3) A failure to comply with subclause (1) or (2) does not affect the validity of an international production order." ;
    skos:definition "relation to international production orders  (1) Within 3 months after an international production order is issued under this Part in response to an application by a control order IPO agency, the chief officer of the agency must:  (a) notify the Ombudsman that the order has been issued; and  (b) give to the Ombudsman a copy of the order.  (2) If the chief officer of a control order IPO agency contravenes paragraph 114(1)(d) of this Schedule (so far as that paragraph relates to an international production order issued under this Part), the chief officer must:  (a) notify the Ombudsman of the contravention; and  (b) do so as soon as practicable after the contravention.  (3) A failure to comply with subclause (1) or (2) does not affect the validity of an international production order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "84eac76313330a622d64f42e8dcb8dd14304b8e5017426895ff9f689d270d36b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "116"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-81-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-81-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-81-ss-3 ;
