concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-85 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "85 Contents of application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-85 ;
    values:originalText "A written application under clause 83 for an international production order must set out:  (a) a statement to the effect that the application is made by the Organisation; and  (b) the name of the person making the application on the Organisation’s behalf." ;
    skos:definition "A written application under clause 83 for an international production order must set out:  (a) a statement to the effect that the application is made by the Organisation; and  (b) the name of the person making the application on the Organisation’s behalf."@en ;
