concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-94 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "94 Contents of written application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-94 ;
    values:originalText "An application under clause 92 must, if it is in writing, set out:  (a) a statement to the effect that the application is made by the Organisation; and  (b) the name of the person making the application on the Organisation’s behalf." ;
    skos:definition "An application under clause 92 must, if it is in writing, set out:  (a) a statement to the effect that the application is made by the Organisation; and  (b) the name of the person making the application on the Organisation’s behalf."@en ;
