concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-98 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "98 Issue of international production order—national security"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-98 ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 92, to a nominated AAT Security Division member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 92, to a nominated AAT Security Division member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
