concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-99 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "99 Content of international production order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-99 ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies to an international production order issued under clause 98. Content  (2) The order must be signed by the nominated AAT Security Division member who issued it.  (3) The order must set out the following:  (a) the date on which the order was issued;  (b) the name of the prescribed communications provider to whom the order is directed;  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies to an international production order issued under clause 98. Content  (2) The order must be signed by the nominated AAT Security Division member who issued it.  (3) The order must set out the following:  (a) the date on which the order was issued;  (b) the name of the prescribed communications provider to whom the order is directed;  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
