concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-101-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "101(4) Application for international production order—national"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-101-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Director-General of Security may authorise in writing, for the purposes of subclause (3), eligible position-holders who, or classes of eligible position-holders who, are entitled under subclause (1) to make applications on the Organisation’s behalf." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Director-General of Security may authorise in writing, for the purposes of subclause (3), eligible position-holders who, or classes of eligible position-holders who, are entitled under subclause (1) to make applications on the Organisation’s behalf."@en ;
