concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-107 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "107 Issue of international production order—national security"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-107 ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 101, to a nominated AAT Security Division member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the nominated AAT Security Division member is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the nominated AAT Security Division member under this Division in connection with the application, that:  (a) there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that the prescribed communications provider holds, or is likely to commence to hold, any of the following telecommunications data:  (i) telecommunications data that relates to communications that the relevant person has made using an individual  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 101, to a nominated AAT Security Division member for an international production order that:  (a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and  (b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider. Issue of international production order  (2) If the nominated AAT Security Division member is satisfied, on the basis of the information given to the nominated AAT Security Division member under this Division in connection with the application, that:  (a) there are reasonable grounds for suspecting that the prescribed communications provider holds, or is likely to commence to hold, any of the following telecommunications data:  (i) telecommunications data that relates to communications that the relevant person has made using an individual  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "143"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-107-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-107-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
