concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-117-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "117(4) Giving of instrument of revocation—the Organisation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-117-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If:  (a) an international production order is revoked under clause 116; and  (b) when the revocation takes effect, the Australian Designated Authority has not made a decision about the order under clause 112; clause 112 ceases to apply to the order when the revocation takes effect.  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If:  (a) an international production order is revoked under clause 116; and  (b) when the revocation takes effect, the Australian Designated Authority has not made a decision about the order under clause 112; clause 112 ceases to apply to the order when the revocation takes effect.  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e8030afd737c2eec96cbacf771530652ea983e8413c0f243a8b251eac1a39e74" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-117 ;
