    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-122-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A cancellation under subclause (1) takes effect:  (a) if the instrument of cancellation is required to be given to the prescribed communications provider concerned—when the instrument is given; or  (b) otherwise—when the cancellation is made." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A cancellation under subclause (1) takes effect:  (a) if the instrument of cancellation is required to be given to the prescribed communications provider concerned—when the instrument is given; or  (b) otherwise—when the cancellation is made."@en ;
