    cof:title "132(2) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies; and  (b) the chief officer of the relevant agency is satisfied that the information is control order information; the chief officer must advise the Minister in writing not to include the information in the next Ministerial report." ;
    cof:pageNumber "165"^^xsd:integer .

