    skos:prefLabel "132(3) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-132-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the Minister is satisfied, on the advice of the chief officer, that the information is control order information, the Minister must:  (a) notify the chief officer in writing; and  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
