doc:sch-1-sec-146-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "146(2) Application of Ombudsman Act" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A reference in section 19 of the Ombudsman Act 1976 to the Ombudsman’s operations does not include a reference to anything that an inspecting officer has done or omitted to do under this Part." ;
    cof:pageNumber "187"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-146-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "146(3) Application of Ombudsman Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-146-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subject to clause 145, subsections 35(2), (3), (4) and (8) of the Ombudsman Act 1976 apply for the purposes of this Part and so apply as if:  (a) a reference in those subsections to an officer were a reference to an inspecting officer; and  (b) a reference in those subsections to information did not include a reference to protected information; and  (c) a reference in those subsections to that Act were a reference to this Part; and  (d) paragraph 35(3)(b) of that Act were omitted; and  (e) section 35A of that Act had not been enacted." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subject to clause 145, subsections 35(2), (3), (4) and (8) of the Ombudsman Act 1976 apply for the purposes of this Part and so apply as if:  (a) a reference in those subsections to an officer were a reference to an inspecting officer; and  (b) a reference in those subsections to information did not include a reference to protected information; and  (c) a reference in those subsections to that Act were a reference to this Part; and  (d) paragraph 35(3)(b) of that Act were omitted; and  (e) section 35A of that Act had not been enacted."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ad02524617438031ff336d7db14c63c1214568a0e8bddc1300a4532c99f761a8" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-146 ;
    cof:pageNumber "187"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of Ombudsman Act to this Part" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
