concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-147 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "147 Exchange of information between Ombudsman and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-147 ;
    values:originalText "State/Territory inspecting authorities  (1) If the Ombudsman has obtained under this Part information relating to an authority of a State or Territory, the Ombudsman may give the information to another authority of that State or Territory (an inspecting authority) that:  (a) has powers under the law of that State or Territory; and  (b) has the function of making inspections of a similar kind to those provided for in clause 142 when the inspecting authority is exercising those powers.  (2) However, the Ombudsman may give the information only if the Ombudsman is satisfied that giving the information is necessary to  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "State/Territory inspecting authorities  (1) If the Ombudsman has obtained under this Part information relating to an authority of a State or Territory, the Ombudsman may give the information to another authority of that State or Territory (an inspecting authority) that:  (a) has powers under the law of that State or Territory; and  (b) has the function of making inspections of a similar kind to those provided for in clause 142 when the inspecting authority is exercising those powers.  (2) However, the Ombudsman may give the information only if the Ombudsman is satisfied that giving the information is necessary to  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "40584630d97f3ebb95592f0378c81fc3f6b9e52a200a02e5ef6ec84e3b0ef8d2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "187"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-147-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-147-ss-2 ;
