concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-148 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "148 Delegation by Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-148 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Ombudsman may, by writing, delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person; all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Part other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Ombudsman may, by writing, delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person; all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Part other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b2734f4ca8818ded8e7c27959f5e7b4e52a0ce0973228bdc33e959de9f7e1f3b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "188"^^xsd:integer ;
