doc:sch-1-sec-149 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "149 Ombudsman not to be sued" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The Ombudsman, an inspecting officer, or a person acting under an inspecting officer’s direction or authority, is not liable to an action, suit or proceeding for or in relation to an act done, or omitted to be done, in good faith in the performance or exercise, or the purported performance or exercise, of a function or power conferred by this Part." ;
