concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-150-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "150(7) Reports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-150-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) The Ombudsman must:  (a) give the chief officer of a relevant agency a copy of so much of a report under subclause (1) or (4) as relates to the relevant agency; and  (b) give the Australian Designated Authority a copy of so much of a report under subclause (1) or (4) as relates to the Australian Designated Authority." ;
    skos:definition "(7) The Ombudsman must:  (a) give the chief officer of a relevant agency a copy of so much of a report under subclause (1) or (4) as relates to the relevant agency; and  (b) give the Australian Designated Authority a copy of so much of a report under subclause (1) or (4) as relates to the Australian Designated Authority."@en ;
