concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-150-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "150(8) Reports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-150-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) A report under this clause must not include information which, if made public, could reasonably be expected to:  (a) endanger a person’s safety; or  (b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or  (c) compromise any relevant agency’s operational activities or methodologies.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(8) A report under this clause must not include information which, if made public, could reasonably be expected to:  (a) endanger a person’s safety; or  (b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or  (c) compromise any relevant agency’s operational activities or methodologies.  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a98e820e51be14bc6c790cc870de3fe5bb6c208d15075db73112399e71f6d319" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-150 ;
