    cof:title "152(1) Prohibition on use, recording or disclosure of protected" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person uses, records or discloses information; and  (b) the information is protected information; and  (c) the use, recording or disclosure of the information is not permitted by this Part. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years." ;
