doc:sch-1-sec-164-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "164(4) Evidentiary certificates—stored communications" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A document purporting to be a certificate issued under subclause (1), (2) or (3):  (a) is to be received in evidence in a proceeding in Australia without further proof; and  (b) in a proceeding in Australia, is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the document.  Amendments  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1  No. 78, 2021 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (International Production Orders) Act 2021" ;
