concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-166 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "166 Evidentiary certificates—Australian Designated Authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-166 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Australian Designated Authority may issue a written certificate signed by the Australian Designated Authority setting out such facts as the Australian Designated Authority considers relevant with respect to:  (a) giving an international production order to a prescribed communications provider; or  (b) giving an instrument of revocation of an international production order to a prescribed communications provider; or  (c) giving an instrument of cancellation to a prescribed communications provider.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Australian Designated Authority may issue a written certificate signed by the Australian Designated Authority setting out such facts as the Australian Designated Authority considers relevant with respect to:  (a) giving an international production order to a prescribed communications provider; or  (b) giving an instrument of revocation of an international production order to a prescribed communications provider; or  (c) giving an instrument of cancellation to a prescribed communications provider.  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1607a562e3c9269811ad1345e02d4eb928a28f0d7eaff63f8eaacfe1cf299b3b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "215"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Issue written certificate with specified facts." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
