concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-171 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "171 Electronic service of documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-171 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given to a person by the Australian Designated Authority:  (i) an international production order;  (ii) a certified copy of an international production order;  (iii) an instrument of revocation of an international production order;  (iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international production order; and  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
