concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-181 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "181 Protection of persons—control order declared to be void"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-181 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) an international production order was issued under Part 3 of this Schedule on the basis that an interim control order was in force; and  (b) a court subsequently declares the interim control order to be void; a criminal proceeding does not lie against a person in respect of anything done in good faith by the person in purported compliance with the international production order.  (2) Subclause (1) does not apply to a thing done at a particular time if, at that time, the person knew, or ought reasonably to have known, of the declaration." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) an international production order was issued under Part 3 of this Schedule on the basis that an interim control order was in force; and  (b) a court subsequently declares the interim control order to be void; a criminal proceeding does not lie against a person in respect of anything done in good faith by the person in purported compliance with the international production order.  (2) Subclause (1) does not apply to a thing done at a particular time if, at that time, the person knew, or ought reasonably to have known, of the declaration."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "808098282b2b2917b247dd94f0eab24d9099c1334656b383b8c63de6914b9117" ;
    cof:pageNumber "227"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-181-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-181-ss-2 ;
