concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-182 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "182 Specification of international agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-182 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) there is an agreement between Australia and one or more foreign countries; and  (b) the name of the agreement is specified in:  (i) regulations made for the purposes of this Schedule; or  (ii) an application made under this Schedule; or  (iii) an international production order; or  (iv) any other instrument made under this Schedule; a reference in the regulations, application, order or other instrument (as the case may be) to the agreement is a reference to the agreement as amended and in force for Australia from time to time.  (2) For the purposes of subclause (1), disregard an amendment of an agreement unless:  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) there is an agreement between Australia and one or more foreign countries; and  (b) the name of the agreement is specified in:  (i) regulations made for the purposes of this Schedule; or  (ii) an application made under this Schedule; or  (iii) an international production order; or  (iv) any other instrument made under this Schedule; a reference in the regulations, application, order or other instrument (as the case may be) to the agreement is a reference to the agreement as amended and in force for Australia from time to time.  (2) For the purposes of subclause (1), disregard an amendment of an agreement unless:  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9905f52055a730badfc476d346a242f795f00b8d02cc01a36cdc9f0640f3f754" ;
    cof:pageNumber "227"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-182-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021-sch-1-sec-182-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.227" .
